<ul class="enc-list"><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/andreas-joseph-hofmann"><span class="enc-name">Andreas Joseph Hofmann</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Andreas Joseph Hofmann was a German philosopher and professor at the University of Mainz who supported the French Revolution.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/andreas-papandreou"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/andreas-papandreou.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Andreas Papandreou</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Andreas Papandreou was a Greek economist and politician who founded the Panhellenic Socialist Movement (PASOK) in 1974, after the fall of the military junta.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/andreas-vesalius"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/andreas-vesalius.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Andreas Vesalius</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Andreas Vesalius was an anatomist and physician from Brussels, often referred to as the founder of modern human anatomy.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encyclopedia/andreas-victor-michiels"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/andreas-victor-michiels.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Andreas Victor Michiels</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Andreas Victor Michiels was a Dutch general who served in the Dutch East Indies.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item"><a href="/encyclopedia/andregoto-galindez"><span class="enc-name">Andregoto Galíndez</span><span class="enc-type">Person</span><span class="enc-snip">Andregoto Galíndez was the heiress of the County of Aragon, daughter of Count Galindo Aznárez II.</span></a></li><li class="enc-item has-img"><a href="/encycloped