ding="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Anglo-Russian Convention</span><span class="enc-type">Treaty · 1907</span><span class="enc-snip">The Anglo-Russian Convention was an agreement of 1907 between Britain and the Russian Empire settling their rivalries in Central Asia.</span></a></li></ul>
